But I wanna push back on this for a minute

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:41.920
because I know how congressional committees think.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:42.960
Okay, go ahead.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:47.440
When Congress passed that massive $19.4 billion package

