we will give you this elevated funding,

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:58.280
but you have a history of administrative chaos.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.640
You have to clean up your act,

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.040
you have to prove you can manage

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.960
a modern healthcare system.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:05.960
Yes, the famous congressional homework.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.760
Right, so did they actually do the homework?

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.880
Because if Puerto Rico walks into a committee room in 2027

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.240
asking for parity,

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:15.920
the first thing any skeptical lawmaker will ask is,

