why should we trust you

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.760
with permanent open-ended funding?

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:22.160
That is the exact hurdle they have to clear.

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:24.920
And the answer, which is meticulously documented

