and economic shift unexpectedly

00:39:33.040 --> 00:39:35.120
alter the political and electoral map

00:39:35.120 --> 00:39:37.880
of critical swing states like Florida or Pennsylvania

00:39:37.880 --> 00:39:40.840
heading right into the 2028 federal elections?

00:39:40.840 --> 00:39:44.600
It is a fascinating and highly sobering hypothetical.

00:39:44.600 --> 00:39:48.120
It proves that the consequences of statutory neglect

00:39:48.120 --> 00:39:51.440
rarely stay confined to the territory they target.

00:39:51.440 --> 00:39:53.280
The math always spills over.

00:39:53.280 --> 00:39:54.520
It always spills over.

00:39:54.520 --> 00:39:55.640
The trapdoor is built.

00:39:55.640 --> 00:39:58.000
We know exactly when it is set to open.

